{"feed":[{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:g3qjiemolflzumnrnb6alnhq/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2jf3l55g22s","cid":"bafyreig4fuwchfekry6a3nob3agbdn6zedexh7rauozckjalgxvoj3hkaq","author":{"did":"did:plc:g3qjiemolflzumnrnb6alnhq","handle":"dmacias.bsky.social","displayName":"David Macias","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:g3qjiemolflzumnrnb6alnhq/bafkreifn3og372pndzxvkoj2edn7lxnqkavre62fexjiface373lswcf2e","associated":{"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2023-05-13T17:11:18.794Z"},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-11-17T15:43:55.248Z","langs":["en"],"text":"Anyone actually seen an outcome-based contract from a BPO or a CCaaS vendor? Those documents must run to encyclopedia length, no room for error on what an outcome is or how it's measured. Maybe the only ones winning this AI race are the lawyers."},"bookmarkCount":0,"replyCount":1,"repostCount":0,"likeCount":0,"quoteCount":0,"indexedAt":"2026-11-17T15:43:56.745Z","labels":[]},"opThreadPostIndex":1,"opThreadPostCount":2},{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:g3qjiemolflzumnrnb6alnhq/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzo7zqwvoc24","cid":"bafyreiatfc7u3edyxbltaegtl5wey5iot6fs3ewom4jx4spxdzs65fe4pm","author":{"did":"did:plc:g3qjiemolflzumnrnb6alnhq","handle":"dmacias.bsky.social","displayName":"David Macias","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:g3qjiemolflzumnrnb6alnhq/bafkreifn3og372pndzxvkoj2edn7lxnqkavre62fexjiface373lswcf2e","associated":{"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2023-05-13T17:11:18.794Z"},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-11-06T20:31:32.581Z","langs":["en"],"text":"Magic Quadrant poll results: 23 votes, 15 leaned disagree, 8 agreed. The 2026 quadrant does not match the reality most of my network sees."},"bookmarkCount":0,"replyCount":1,"repostCount":0,"likeCount":0,"quoteCount":0,"indexedAt":"2026-11-06T20:31:32.882Z","labels":[]},"opThreadPostIndex":1,"opThreadPostCount":2},{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:g3qjiemolflzumnrnb6alnhq/app.bsky.feed.post/3myuoifu7ms2m","cid":"bafyreid5gigas6m4g247alw6fc4yhgtglzoufstjwazrnem3anbixo5pz4","author":{"did":"did:plc:g3qjiemolflzumnrnb6alnhq","handle":"dmacias.bsky.social","displayName":"David Macias","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:g3qjiemolflzumnrnb6alnhq/bafkreifn3og372pndzxvkoj2edn7lxnqkavre62fexjiface373lswcf2e","associated":{"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2023-05-13T17:11:18.794Z"},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-10-27T16:41:03.463Z","langs":["en"],"text":"New Five9 survey: 46% of customers rated their last chatbot experience positively, vs about two-thirds for a human. The top reason people bail on the bot? It repeatedly misunderstood them. Turns out the human exit isn't the failure mode, it's the feature."},"bookmarkCount":0,"replyCount":1,"repostCount":0,"likeCount":1,"quoteCount":0,"indexedAt":"2026-10-27T16:41:06.196Z","labels":[]},"opThreadPostIndex":1,"opThreadPostCount":2},{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:g3qjiemolflzumnrnb6alnhq/app.bsky.feed.post/3mykeesoozk27","cid":"bafyreiaavhjo6j4vv4ieveszfa7chhxdyvadumpwjboxh4ct3xfsomkc3i","author":{"did":"did:plc:g3qjiemolflzumnrnb6alnhq","handle":"dmacias.bsky.social","displayName":"David Macias","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:g3qjiemolflzumnrnb6alnhq/bafkreifn3og372pndzxvkoj2edn7lxnqkavre62fexjiface373lswcf2e","associated":{"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2023-05-13T17:11:18.794Z"},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-10-23T14:13:27.893Z","embed":{"$type":"app.bsky.embed.images","images":[{"alt":"","aspectRatio":{"height":812,"width":807},"image":{"$type":"blob","ref":{"$link":"bafkreigan6ejrrbuzg2oohqnlttmzsyc2smxprsygjtqtf7tqgn5mtywky"},"mimeType":"image/jpeg","size":233584}}]},"langs":["en"],"text":"Remember when every vendor said AI's focus was not to reduce agent count? Well how about it reducing your agent license count?\n\nZoom CX is moving to one spend pool for seats, apps, and AI. A seat you can count. A draw-down pool is their meter, and renewals just got harder to justify."},"embed":{"images":[{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:g3qjiemolflzumnrnb6alnhq/bafkreigan6ejrrbuzg2oohqnlttmzsyc2smxprsygjtqtf7tqgn5mtywky","fullsize":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:g3qjiemolflzumnrnb6alnhq/bafkreigan6ejrrbuzg2oohqnlttmzsyc2smxprsygjtqtf7tqgn5mtywky","alt":"","aspectRatio":{"height":812,"width":807}}],"$type":"app.bsky.embed.images#view"},"bookmarkCount":0,"replyCount":1,"repostCount":0,"likeCount":0,"quoteCount":0,"indexedAt":"2026-10-23T14:13:31.139Z","labels":[]},"opThreadPostIndex":1,"opThreadPostCount":2},{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:g3qjiemolflzumnrnb6alnhq/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxtszu3z3c2s","cid":"bafyreifyqidnmk5isojgwwhm76bia77jkeqatdcanazapwb3qismbpwhyy","author":{"did":"did:plc:g3qjiemolflzumnrnb6alnhq","handle":"dmacias.bsky.social","displayName":"David Macias","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:g3qjiemolflzumnrnb6alnhq/bafkreifn3og372pndzxvkoj2edn7lxnqkavre62fexjiface373lswcf2e","associated":{"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2023-05-13T17:11:18.794Z"},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-10-14T15:04:32.425Z","langs":["en"],"text":"A VC firm read 67 SaaS earnings calls and concluded AI is great for SaaS valuations. Anyway, the underlying numbers on outcome pricing and MCP growth are worth your time if you read past the pitch."},"bookmarkCount":0,"replyCount":1,"repostCount":0,"likeCount":0,"quoteCount":0,"indexedAt":"2026-10-14T15:04:33.659Z","labels":[]},"opThreadPostIndex":1,"opThreadPostCount":2},{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:g3qjiemolflzumnrnb6alnhq/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxgxex5d3c2g","cid":"bafyreiaj3fgsbynixdjtkgashi7lydvaw2zmfpdgio27jpz6pytbb